<title>USA: Gloucester, Mass., notes won by AH Williams.</title>
<headline>Gloucester, Mass., notes won by AH Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>AH Williams &amp; Co said Thursday it won $15 million Gloucester, Mass., bond anticipation notes at a net interest cost of 4.1099 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
